<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1245] Continuous query listeners created by clients are not registered on joining nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1245</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scenario:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start server node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start client node, start continuous query from client&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;start one more server node, continuous query listeners is not registered on this node&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Added test IgniteCacheContinuousQueryClientTest.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
